  "clause_evidence": {
    "u6-req-0085": "Actual signed public Session startup remains accepted while either accepted native/SIP Participant lacks its observed ready Connection. Negotiation alone is insufficient. Native-last and SIP-last arrival, a real connected-recording failure recovered without another packet/redial, different selected codecs, current authorization/runtime/generation/epoch checks, and public handoff promotion from actual prior private flow establish the bounded local readiness predicate. An unready accepted scanner queues no writer behind existing media readers. Initial and established telephone projections reuse current guarded-media validation; originals remain metadata only.",
    "u6-req-0100": "This is the Session-boundary context statement, not a separate new behavior. Current production regressions establish default30-second confirmed loss grace, packet-silence independence, current negotiation spanning grace, immediate explicit end, same-SID reconnect and owned-listener restart. Existing immutable original invitation replay and refusal after terminal loss retain the separation between continuation and a fresh invitation. The same durable connected/loss model now reconciles actual telephone lifecycle metadata."
  },
  "limits": [
    "Local macOS arm64 canonical native QUIC and actual loopback UDP SIP. Mixed startup has six actual signed cases across EdDSA/ES256 and PCMU/PCMA; initial public handoff activation is an EdDSA case. Wider Linux, browser, remote/provider and frozen workload profiles retain their assigned tasks.",
    "Initial readiness is an observed current Connection predicate. Native sources require actual direction-appropriate flow; initial SIP sources require actual owned dialog and guarded Core admission. This does not claim every packet was consumed remotely or every future cross-product/fault profile has been run.",
    "The pre-start codec snapshot uses captured current native binding metadata; its targeted latest-binding regression is controlled Store evidence. Public live codec execution remains covered by the three current production worker regressions. No additional physical pre-start renegotiation scenario is inferred.",
    "Only common selected descriptors are reported globally. Different selected formats have exact per-Connection descriptors; no union is presented as a common format. Actual SIP interop reports sip-interop, following the pinned protocol source.",
    "The handoff case verifies initial phase/current trusted snapshot after actual public promotion, without new flow. Existing private-origin discovery and record/source visibility checks remain enforced; no broad disclosure of historical private metadata is inferred.",
    "The source ledger independent conformance remains G6-094. The two credits are bounded local Connect qualification, including context0100 as a link to already implemented boundary behavior. G6-046, gate acceptance, publication and all105-task completion remain open."
  ],
  "corrected_during_verification": [
    "The first new production run passed public handoff activation and SIP-last recording recovery, but SIP-first admission failed. A held-read regression reproduced authority-busy: the accepted-session scanner queued conversation writers even without complete readiness. Exact read-only readiness preflight now avoids that writer until eligible; final production checks validate the correction.",
    "The original first-flow codec summary could be stale after an actual captured codec update while other accepted Participants remained unready. Activation now reads current captured native codec bindings without rewriting the immutable first-flow fact.",
    "The concurrent native/SIP recovery case exposed a fresh Store read inside the nested Core media-admission callback. The accepted Endpoint/route media interval is now acquired before Core, reused by its exact typed admission invocation and callback, and released with that bounded call. Ringing still uses signaling authority. No Core admission or SIP submission is repeated.",
    "The two existing duplex initial-call regressions initially delivered seven marked native packets, below the unchanged greater-than-ten threshold. A cheap negative observed-coverage scan preflight improved that to ten but did not close the failures. Trace evidence then identified full operation-record/visible-journal causal projections inside every SIP packet read. The packet path now queries only the exact owned call lifetime, current operation state/cancellation and the same full current media authority. Operation display reads retain their original full causal projection. Both duplex regressions pass with unchanged workloads and thresholds. Storage outages retain storage-unavailable rather than being mistaken for withdrawn authority.",
    "Initial SIP connected recording originally abandoned an actually admitted leg on transient storage failure. Its bounded retry retains the same actual controller/leg and records metadata only, with cancellation/current authority intact and no second origination/admission."
  ],
